    "body_text": "Skip to content Buy Rent House Prices Find Agent Commercial Inspire Overseas Sign in Sign in Buy Property for sale New homes for sale Property valuation Investors Mortgages Rent Property to rent Student property to rent Find Agent Find estate agents House prices Sold house prices Instant online valuation Commercial Commercial property to rent Commercial property for sale Advertise Inspire Moving stories Property news Energy efficiency Property guides Housing trends Overseas blog Mortgage guides Overseas All countries Spain France Portugal Italy Greece Currency Sell Overseas property See similar properties Click to open video Property photo 1 of 17. 1/171 150 High Street, London, E15 £2,125 pcm £490 pw Tenancy info Reduced today Letting details Let available date: Now Deposit: £2,451 Furnish type: Part furnished Council Tax: Ask agent PROPERTY TYPE Apartment BEDROOMS 2 BATHROOMS 2 SIZE Ask agent 1 +11 Key features Tesco Express OnsitePet FriendlyLift AccessClose to Westfield Stratford CityExcellent Transport Links via Stratford Station Description Available now, perfect for sharers or couples, just moments from Stratford Station and Westfield. Folio London is pleased to offer this well-presented 2-bedroom apartment in part of the Stratford Halo development. Located in a Stratford Halo development, this apartment offers a peaceful living experience while still benefiting from the convenience of East London’s vibrant Stratford neighbourhood. The apartment features a modern open-plan kitchen and living area, a spacious double bedroom, and excellent storage throughout. Offered furnished, it’s ideal for professionals seeking a stylish and comfortable home. The development is just a short walk from Stratford Station and Westfield Stratford City, offering excellent transport links and shopping options. To meet Folio referencing criteria, your household must earn a minimum of £65,250 per annum. There are no estate or service charges with this property. This property falls within Council Tax Band D. Please allow 5 working days from the advertised available date for any maintenance or void works to be completed. Please note, photos may be of a similar property. Read full description COUNCIL TAX Band: D PARKING Ask agent GARDEN Ask agent ACCESSIBILITY Ask agent Energy Performance Certificate Utilities, rights & restrictions 150 High Street, London, E15 Approximate location Open map Street View My places Stations Schools Add an important place to see how long it'd take to get there from our property listings. __mins driving to your place Broadband speed About Folio London, London 2 Killick Street London N1 9FL Folio London Are Here For Renters Folio London is a premier Build to Rent property developer dedicated to transforming the rental experience across the capital. More than just providing a roof over your head, Folio London is committed to inspiring and supporting renters with high-quality homes and exceptional service. With over 3,000 homes available at various price points, we cater to a diverse range of tenants from all backgrounds and corners of the globe, offering the reassurance, security, and stability of renting with an organisation rather than an individual. Our developments reflect a commitment to quality and convenience, ensuring that every renter can find a home that suits their lifestyle in the dynamic city of London. Read more View our properties to rent Find out more about us Notes These notes are private, only you can see them. Save note MARKETED BY Folio London, London 2 Killick Street London N1 9FL More properties from this agent Call agent Request details Staying secure when looking for property Ensure you're up to date with our latest advice on how to avoid fraud or scams when looking for property online. Visit our security centre to find out more Disclaimer - Property reference SHE210053_L. The information displayed about this property comprises a property advertisement. Rightmove.co.uk makes no w