    "description": "Available now, perfect for sharers or couples, just moments from Stratford Station and Westfield. Folio London is pleased to offer this well-presented 2-bedroom apartment in part of the Stratford Halo development. Located in a Stratford Halo development, this apartment offers a peaceful living experience while still benefiting from the convenience of East London’s vibrant Stratford neighbourhood. The apartment features a modern open-plan kitchen and living area, a spacious double bedroom, and excellent storage throughout. Offered furnished, it’s ideal for professionals seeking a stylish and comfortable home. The development is just a short walk from Stratford Station and Westfield Stratford City, offering excellent transport links and shopping options. To meet Folio referencing criteria, your household must earn a minimum of £65,250 per annum. There are no estate or service charges with this property. This property falls within Council Tax Band D. Please allow 5 working days from the advertised available date for any maintenance or void works to be completed. Please note, photos may be of a similar property. Read full description COUNCIL TAX Band: D PARKING Ask agent GARDEN Ask agent ACCESSIBILITY Ask agent Energy Performance Certificate Utilities, rights & restrictions 150 High Street, London, E15 Approximate location Open map Street View My places Stations Schools Add an important place to see how long it'd take to get there from our property listings. __mins driving to your place Broadband speed About Folio London, London 2 Killick Street London N1 9FL Folio London Are Here For Renters Folio London is a premier Build to Rent property developer dedicated to transforming the rental experience across the capital. More than just providing a roof over your head, Folio London is committed to inspiring and supporting renters with high-quality homes and exceptional service. With over 3,000 homes available at various price points, we cater to a diverse